ADDENDA <Act No. 8626, Aug. 3, 2007>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (General Transitional Measures)
Dispositions, proceedings, and other acts made or done under the previous Fisheries Act and the previous Overseas Resources Development Business Act before this Act enters into force shall be deemed made or done under this Act, if relevant provisions exist in this Act.
Article 3 (Transitional Measure concerning Permission, Reporting, etc.)
The previous provisions shall apply to cases regarding which an application for permission or a report was filed pursuant to the previous Fisheries Act and the former Overseas Resources Development Business Act before this Act enters into force and the process for which is still pending as at the time this Act enters into force.
Article 4 (Transitional Measure concerning Penalty Provisions, etc.)
A violation of the previous Fisheries Act before this Act enters into force shall be governed by the previous penalty provisions or previous provisions regarding administrative fines.
Article 5 (Transitional Measures concerning Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association)
(1) When the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association (hereinafter referred to as the "Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association"), established as an incorporated association under the Civil Act before this Act enters into force, completes the registration for incorporation with approval therefor from the Minister of Maritime Affairs and Fisheries following resolution by its board of directors on succession to its status shall be deemed the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28. In such cases, the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association shall be deemed dissolved, notwithstanding the provisions concerning the dissolution and liquidation of a corporation in the Civil Act.
(2) The assets, rights, and obligations of the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association under paragraph (1) shall be deemed the assets, rights, and obligations of the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28, and the title of the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association registered in the registers and other official records concerning such assets, rights, and obligations shall be deemed the title of the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28.
(3) The value of assets deemed owned by the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28 under paragraph (2) shall be based on the book value as at the date immediately before the registration date of incorporation under paragraph (1).
(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1), acts done by the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association before this Act shall be deemed acts done by the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28, while acts done to or against the incorporated Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association shall be deemed acts done to or against the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28.
(5) For the purpose of paragraph (1), executives and employees of the Korea Deep Sea Fisheries Association as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed elected or appointed as executives and employees of the Overseas Fisheries Association established under Article 28. In such cases, the term of office for each executive shall coincide with the remaining term of office under the previous articles of association of the Korea Overseas Fisheries Association.
Article 6 Omitted.
Article 7 (Relationship to other Acts and Subordinate Statutes)
A citation of the Fisheries Act or any provision thereof in any other Act or subordinate statute in force as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed a citation of this Act or the relevant provision hereof in lieu of the Fisheries Act or the previous provision, if such provision exists herein.

